{"id":423,"title":"挑战4: 带乘法的嵌套循环（基础）","summary":" 一个小的高级挑战，其中涉及嵌套循环，循环变量随着每次乘法而增加。  \n","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"fabba082-bec6-4dc7-b944-6e4dd0c9f5f1","text":"## 问题\n\n计算下面的代码的复杂度。最好在一张纸上先解决，然后对比答案是否正确。\n\n### 代码","text_html":"<h2>问题</h2>\n<p>计算下面的代码的复杂度。最好在一张纸上先解决，然后对比答案是否正确。</p>\n<h3>代码</h3>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a76e2770-e96d-4e1a-bb16-122aa10210b1","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"n = 10  # n 可以为任意值\nsum = 0\npie = 3.14\nvar = 1\nwhile var < n:\n    print(pie)\n    for j in range(1, n, 2):\n        sum += 1\n    var *= 3\nprint(sum)\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4fb89c7c-fcaa-487a-a792-f95c1a8572cd","text":"如果你已经计算了上述代码的时间复杂度，请回答下面的问题，看看结果是否与正确答案一致。","text_html":"<p>如果你已经计算了上述代码的时间复杂度，请回答下面的问题，看看结果是否与正确答案一致。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2},{"type":"Quiz","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a138aeea-d7c4-49e6-91ea-9354be89ebc7","title":"","title_html":"","render_mode":"slide","questions":[{"question_id":189,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"以下哪项最能表示上面写的程序的复杂度？","question_text_html":"<p>以下哪项最能表示上面写的程序的复杂度？</p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"$O(n)$\n","text_html":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span cl